&quot; and other seemingly harmless words actually contain sensitive words! ! ! ! Everyone is talking about ji, don't bring it, be civilized.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The rules have become very casual</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The words that were not sensitive yesterday are sensitive today. New policy: ghost characters are not allowed. Don't let any ghost go.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warm reminder</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends who have not yet taken the college entrance examination, please play with caution, this game may have a negative impact on your Chinese level.</p>", "short_description": "This is an auditor simulator game. You play as an ordinary auditor of the pen station. Check whether there are sensitive words in the live broadcast barrage. If there are sensitive words, press the space bar immediately to take them down. Omissions and misjudgments will deduct performance.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355760/header.jpg?t=1750422281", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355760/bf6534e8b7c4717bd3d66ef2a349d97e5956af12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750422281", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355760/bf6534e8b7c4717bd3d66ef2a349d97e5956af12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750422281", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 都行吧应该<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 960m<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 都行吧应该<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 都行吧应该<br></li><li><st